Subject: [PATCH] Standalone OCTA-CAPTURE audio, MIDI and read-only status

Use descriptor formats, vendor clock setup and both MIDI cables.
Expose the bounded status pipe through a read-only ALSA control,
without userspace interface detachment or audio-path changes.

---
